    <div>
      <p begin="00:24.100" end="00:26.950" ttm:agent="v1">Killer on a killing spree, killer on a killing spree</p>
      <p begin="00:26.950" end="00:29.850" ttm:agent="v1">East side, west side, bitch, you better not fuck with me</p>
      <p begin="00:29.850" end="00:32.750" ttm:agent="v1">Killer on a killing spree, killer on a killing spree</p>
      <p begin="00:32.750" end="00:35.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(dwilly, I'm scared) Ayy, ayy</p>
      <p begin="00:35.350" end="00:36.850" ttm:agent="v1">Got them bullets, let 'em fly</p>
      <p begin="00:36.480" end="00:38.220" ttm:agent="v1">Bro, you can't be that guy, huh</p>
      <p begin="00:38.220" end="00:39.720" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, you sudden broke?</p>
      <p begin="00:39.420" end="00:41.030" ttm:agent="v1">Had to fish for change and likes</p>
      <p begin="00:41.030" end="00:42.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Motherfucker, get back, I smoke (Ginseng, where are you?)</p>
      <p begin="00:42.880" end="00:44.380" ttm:agent="v1">Anybody that cross that line</p>
      <p begin="00:44.230" end="00:45.730" ttm:agent="v1">Anybody that wanna get sticked</p>
      <p begin="00:45.500" end="00:47.320" ttm:agent="v1">Don't wanna get next in line, yuh</p>
      <p begin="00:47.320" end="00:48.930" ttm:agent="v1">Light it up, then fly, huh</p>
      <p begin="00:48.930" end="00:50.430" ttm:agent="v1">Light it up, then fly, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:50.380" end="00:51.880" ttm:agent="v1">Light it up, then fly, huh</p>
      <p begin="00:51.870" end="00:53.370" ttm:agent="v1">Light it up, then fly, huh</p>
      <p begin="00:53.350" end="00:54.990" ttm:agent="v1">You can't be that guy, huh</p>
      <p begin="00:54.990" end="00:56.490" ttm:agent="v1">You can't be that guy, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:56.430" end="00:58.070" ttm:agent="v1">Light it up, then fly, huh</p>
      <p begin="00:58.070" end="00:59.570" ttm:agent="v1">Light it up, then fly</p>
      <p begin="00:59.560" end="01:01.060" ttm:agent="v1">L-l-light it up, then-</p>
      <p begin="01:00.750" end="01:03.230" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, yeah, huh, tell that bitch don't step</p>
      <p begin="01:03.230" end="01:06.050" ttm:agent="v1">See the feds, I see red, run up on me, you gon' get slept</p>
      <p begin="01:06.050" end="01:08.940" ttm:agent="v1">I got money, I got guns, I got plenty, you got none</p>
      <p begin="01:08.940" end="01:12.100" ttm:agent="v1">See them talking, need revenge, then get to steppin', get some funds</p>
      <p begin="01:12.100" end="01:15.260" ttm:agent="v1">Like, uh, yeah, never gon' see this much in your life</p>
      <p begin="01:15.260" end="01:16.770" ttm:agent="v1">Never gon' get rich quick with a mic</p>
      <p begin="01:16.770" end="01:19.020" ttm:agent="v1">Never gon' flex no bitch, you a dyke, bitch, give up</p>
      <p begin="01:19.020" end="01:21.280" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, steppin' in Ricks, get kicked in the spot</p>
      <p begin="01:21.280" end="01:22.780" ttm:agent="v1">World War Three, these boys gon' fly</p>
      <p begin="01:22.750" end="01:24.710" ttm:agent="v1">Your whole music career was a lie, bitch</p>
      <p begin="01:24.710" end="01:26.210" ttm:agent="v1">Fly</p>
      <p begin="01:25.530" end="01:27.110" ttm:agent="v1">Bro, you can't be that guy, huh</p>
      <p begin="01:27.110" end="01:28.610" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, you sudden broke?</p>
      <p begin="01:28.370" end="01:29.890" ttm:agent="v1">Had to fish for change and likes</p>
