      <p begin="01:49.520" end="01:52.310" ttm:agent="v1">Huh, huh, huh, fly</p>
      <p begin="01:52.310" end="01:55.420" ttm:agent="v1">I can elevate you when you get this high</p>
      <p begin="01:55.420" end="01:58.790" ttm:agent="v1">Hm, hm, hm, fly</p>
      <p begin="01:58.790" end="02:00.970" ttm:agent="v1">If I say I'm 508, then be outside</p>
      <p begin="02:00.970" end="02:04.350" ttm:agent="v1">When I told you to keep it basic, you had to show out</p>
      <p begin="02:04.350" end="02:07.340" ttm:agent="v1">Angry 'cause I hate places that ain't my own house</p>
      <p begin="02:07.340" end="02:10.510" ttm:agent="v1">Faces, me and you make it and kick the door down</p>
      <p begin="02:10.510" end="02:13.460" ttm:agent="v1">Me and you look fly, we're together like our own cloud</p>
